<article class="env-lemma" id="0CYE">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CYE">Lemma <span data-tag="0CYE">91.12.3</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/0CYD" data-tag="0CYD">91.12.2</a> the obstruction class $o(\mathcal{F}, f^*\mathcal{J}_2 \otimes _\mathcal {O} \mathcal{F}, 1)$ maps to the obstruction class $o(\mathcal{F}, f^*\mathcal{J}_1 \otimes _\mathcal {O} \mathcal{F}, 1)$ under the canonical map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^2_\mathcal {O}( \mathcal{F}, f^*\mathcal{J}_2 \otimes _\mathcal {O} \mathcal{F}) \to \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^2_\mathcal {O}( \mathcal{F}, f^*\mathcal{J}_1 \otimes _\mathcal {O} \mathcal{F})  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Remark <a href="/tag/0CYC" data-tag="0CYC">91.10.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>